  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson Synthetic Gut Power 16 is a solid-core nylon string featuring high-energy wraps for crisp feel, responsive power and dependable control. The thicker 16 gauge (1.30 mm) increases durability and stringbed stability compared with the 17 gauge while maintaining excellent comfort and arm-friendly performance.",

    "zh": "Wilson Synthetic Gut Power 16 是一款采用 Solid Core Nylon（实心尼龙）结构的合成肠线，配备 High Energy Wraps 外层包覆，可提供清晰的击球反馈、轻松的力量输出以及稳定的控制。相比 17（1.25mm），16（1.30mm）拥有更好的耐久性、更稳定的线床表现和更长的使用寿命，同时依然保持舒适、易打以及对手臂友好的特点。"
  },

